"entity": {
"name": "ELVALHALCOR HELLENIC COPPER AND ALUMINIUM INDUSTRY S.A.",
"description": "ElvalHalcor Hellenic Copper & Aluminium Industry SA engages in the provision of aluminium and copper processing industrial products and solutions. It operates through the Aluminium Products and Copper Products segments. The Aluminium Products segment produces and sells a range of aluminium products and alloys. The Copper Products segment offers copper and copper alloys rolled and extruded products. The firm serves the transportation, packaging, renewable energy, packaging, building and construction, and fish farming markets. The company was founded on March 2, 1977 and is headquartered in Athens, Greece.",
